contentText:
Pink just shut down &#8220;fake news&#8221; reports that she Carey Hart separated after 20 years of marriage, sharing a cheeky video of herself walking around in her kitchen poking fun at the headlines.

&#8220;I was just alerted to the fact that I&#8217;m separated from my husband &#8212; I didn&#8217;t know,&#8221; she quips sarcastically at the beginning of the clip posted Thursday (Feb. 26) on Instagram , sticking her tongue out. &#8220;Thank you for letting me know. I was wondering, would you also like to tell our children?&#8221;

